324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Outliers in the numeric columns were checked using the interquartile range \(IQR\) method \(values beyond 1.5 x IQR from the first/third quartiles were flagged\). Tutoring_Sessions and Hours_Studied showed a number of statistically flagged high values, but these are plausible real-world behaviours \(some students attend many tutoring sessions or study long hours\) and were retained rather than removed. The target variable, Exam_Score, contained 1 record\(s\) with a value above the maximum possible score of 100, which is not a plausible outcome and was therefore treated as a data entry artefact; this value was capped \(winsorised\) at 100 rather than deleted, preserving the record while correcting the impossible value.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [15]
>>
