436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 153 0 R
/E (The distribution of Exam Score is unimodal and concentrated tightly around the mean of 67.24 \(standard deviation 3.89\), with most students scoring between roughly 65 and 70. The distribution shows a mild positive skew \(skewness = 1.64\) caused by a small number of high-performing students in the upper tail; a small number of originally implausible values above 100 were corrected during cleaning \(Section 4.4\). This confirms Exam Score is well-behaved enough for linear modelling without a transformation.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
